Subject: [PATCH 0008] Prism: space windows + chrome://prism-spaces page

Wires the Phase 4 chrome layer:
- chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn: compile the SpaceWindowDelegate
  implementation (opens/focuses one Browser per space, moves the space's
  windowless tabs into its tab strip, pins chrome://prism-spaces as the
  identity tab, paints the click-highlight overlay widget)
- chrome/browser/ui/webui/{BUILD.gn,prism_spaces/}: the management page —
  plain HTML/JS served via a WebUIDataSource request filter (no grit),
  SpaceManager data over data.json, actions over chrome.send

New sources live in the src-overlay (chrome/browser/prism/,
chrome/browser/ui/webui/prism_spaces/).

